                    <details>CryoEM movies of nitrogenase (MoFeP + FeP) from Azotobacter vinelandii under catalytic turnover conditions. Data were collected on a G3i Titan Krios (300 kV) at a nominal magnification of 135,000x (0.835 Å/pixel) on a K3 detector post a BioQuantum energy filter (20 eV slit) and a cumulative exposure of ~65 electrons/Å2 (66 frames) recorded in counting mode. Data were collected automatically using EPU with aberration free image shift using a defocus range of -0.5 – -2.5 μm.</details>
                </journalCitation>
            </universalCitation>
        </citationList>
